      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IN CONFIDENCE (2) was far too good in this grade last start, jumping a $1.18 favourite and winning comfortably. She's a nice horse on the rise and Fiore reunites with her today as she steps to the mile for the first time. Scarily, there seems to be more to come from her out in trip and she can continue to build on her impressive record. BELLE JOURNEE (6) bounced back last start when settling closer, winning by 0.9L in a strong performance. She rates highly on the back of that, though she may end up back in the run again from the draw. Expecting her to be in the finish again on her latest effort. GINGER GREEN (3) is hard to knock this time in, finishing behind Lillian last time out in high rating race. He'll need some luck from the draw, but he's racing in good order and if he can get across from out wide, he'll be hard to reel in. ROMANTIC RULER (5) can repeat the dose stepping back up in trip. CHANGING GUARD (7) won't be far away.",
